5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We should prioritize evidence of what actually works. I want to see the readmission figures during the call-back trial and the visit completion on the shared nursing round.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I am concerned about the physical and digital infrastructure. I will look into rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, and what the booking system records.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A logical approach requires knowing why previous collaborations failed. I'll examine the board minutes on a jointly run clinic and data agreements with outside surgeries.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I want to make sure the staff aren't too tired! I'll check the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, and the therapy and midwifery staffing review.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is wise to look at the foundation first. I shall examine this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs by contact location.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
